small\"> - October 16, 2026</span></dt>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"text-overflow\">Soybeans pulled off early losses on Friday, as contracts were down 1 ¾ to 3 cents in the front month and up ½ to 1 ¾ cents in the deferreds. November was 30 ¾ cents lower for the week. We are over halfway through October, as the average close for...</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dt>Corn Falls on Friday as Spec Longs Continue Exit<span class=\"byline small\"> - October 16, 2026</span></dt>\n\t\t\t\t\t<dd class=\"text-overflow\">Corn futures closed out the Friday session with contracts 1 to 4 ½ cents across the board, as December was 5 ½ cents lower. The CmdtyView national average Cash Corn price was down 3 3/4 cents at $4.35. Now halfway through October the average close for December futures has been...</dd>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"text-right\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/markets/commentary.php?market=\">Full Commentary...</a>\n\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!---->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<hr />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!---->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 pull-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"h4 title-block\"> </div>\n\t<div><div>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.agricharts.com/sites/709/WheatDiscountSchedule2026(8.12.26).pdf\" title=\"Current Spring Wheat Discount Schedule\">Current Spring Wheat Discount Schedule</a><br></span></h3>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.agricharts.com/sites/709/SoybeanDiscountSchedule 2026.pdf\" title=\"Current Soybean Discount Schedule\">Current Soybean Discount Schedule</a></span></h3>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.agricharts.com/sites/709/Corn Discount Schedule 2025.pdf\" title=\"Current Corn Discount Schedule\">Current Corn Discount Schedule</a><br></span></h3>\r\n<h3><a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/m